[Event "Steffen Nielsen 50 JT 1st prize"]
[Site "?"]
[Date "2026.05.01"]
[Round "?"]
[White "Neuenschwander=B Hergert=V"]
[Black "(+0011.26h1e1)"]
[Result "1-0"]
[FEN "N7/1p6/pP3p2/4p3/p2p4/3P4/8/1B2k2K w - - 0 1"]
1. Nc7 $1 (1. Kg2 $2 e4 $1 { (or 1. ..a3 2.Nc7 e4! etc)} 2. dxe4 a3 3. Nc7 d3
$1 4. Nd5 d2 5. Nc3 d1=Q 6. Nxd1 Kxd1 {and White must fight for the draw:} 7.
Ba2 $1 Kc1 8. Bd5 Kb1 9. e5 $1 fxe5 10. Bxb7 a2 11. Be4+ Kc1 12. b7 a1=Q 13.
b8=Q $11) 1... e4 $1 {Black defends actively by creating another passed pawn.}
(1... Kd2 2. Kg2 $1 Kc1 3. Ba2 $18)  (1... f5 2. Ne6 $18) 2. dxe4 (2. Nxa6 $4
e3 $19)  (2. Ne6 $2 Kd2 $1 3. dxe4 Kc1 4. Bd3 (4. Ba2 d3 $11) 4... Kb2 $1 5.
Nxd4 Kc3 6. Bxa6 Kxd4 7. Bxb7 Kc5 8. Bd5 Kxb6 $11) 2... a3 3. Nxa6 $1 (3. Nd5
$2 d3 $1 4. Nc3 d2 5. Bc2 d1=Q 6. Bxd1 Kd2 7. Nb1+ Kxd1 8. Nxa3 Kd2 $1 9. Nc4+
Kc3 $1 10. Nd6 Kb4 $1 11. Nxb7 Kb5 12. Nd6+ Kxb6 $11) 3... d3 $1 {Black's only
chance is to continue playing actively. } 4. Bxd3 a2 5. Nb4 a1=Q 6. Nc2+ Kd2+
7. Nxa1 {So, the knight has moved from the a8 corner to the a1 corner! But only
half of the job is done...} 7... Kxd3 8. Nc2 $1 (8. Nb3 $2 Kxe4 9. Nc5+ Kd5 10.
Nxb7 Kc6 11. Na5+ Kxb6 $11) 8... Kxe4 (8... Kxc2 9. Kg2 Kd3 10. Kf3 Kd4 11. Kf4
Kc5 12. Kf5 $18) 9. Nb4 Kd4 10. Na6 $1 Kc4 11. Nc7 Kc5 12. Na8 {Switchback to
a8! The knight has moved back to a8 exactly on the same path it took to a1 in
the first place!} 1-0

