Ke3 14. Kf1 Kf3 15. Kg1 Rg6+ $10) 1... Kf4 2. b7 Re8 3. Kg2 $1 (3. a6 Kxf3 4.
Kh4 Kf4 {etc.} ) 3... Ke3 {The other black resource.}  (3... Re2+ {The defence
in the try does not work here} 4. Kf1 Rb2 5. a6 Kxf3 6. Ke1 Ke3 7. Kd1 Kxd3 8.
Kc1 $18 {gains the decisive tempo} ) 4. a6 Rg8+ 5. Kh3 $1 (5. Kf1 $2 Kxf3 6. a7
Rh8 7. Ke1 Ke3 8. Kd1 Kxd3 9. Kc1 Kc3 10. Kb1 Rh1+ 11. Ka2 Rh2+ 12. Ka3 Rh1 13.
Ka4 Kc4 14. Ka5 Kc5 15. Ka4 Kc4 $10) 5... Kxf3 6. Kh4 Kf4 7. Kh5 Kf5 8. Kh6 Kf6
9. Kh7 {Tempo gain (Roman theme).} 9... Rb8 10. d4 Ke6 11. Kg6 $1 Rg8+ 12. Kh6
$1 (12. Kh7 Rb8 {=time loss} )  (12. Kh5 Kf5 13. Kh6 Kf6 14. Kh7 Rb8 {=time
loss} ) 12... Kf6 13. Kh7 {Final decisive tempo gain.} 13... Rb8 14. d5 Ke5 15.
Kg6 Rg8+ 16. Kf7 Rb8 17. Ke7 Kxd5 18. Kd7 Kc5 19. Kc7 1-0

